lose`, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`202609/unrelated_red_gate_bead_close.md`, a path, a `plan:` ref, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the planner agent, or the old notification ID), TAB-complete [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]pending plan names with rich descriptions, and explain every miss [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]precisely instead of printing \"pending plan approval not found\".[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]plan_approve_names.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/plan_approve_names.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-17z[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-17z/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate-owned visibility and the name-first selector resolver[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolver[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver: make pending-plan visibility gate-shell aware, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lightweight plan-name module, replace the ID-only selector with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact-then-prefix resolver and its miss diagnosis, and render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]approve/reject errors, ambiguity, and success beautifully.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]TAB completion for pending plan names[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolver[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion: add the `pending_plan` value kind with a fast-path provider [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that mirrors the resolver's visibility rule, bind it to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]approve/reject PLAN slot, and keep candidates fresh with a short [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-kind cache TTL in every shell.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Names everywhere plans are listed[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolver[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: lead `sase plan list` Proposed rows and `sase plan show` hints[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the plan name, add a `name` JSON field, and finish the name-first [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-17z","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-17z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-17z.1"},"source_run_id":"run-07a29264f9c9105a95ef623a313e7181","started_at":"2026-09-24T16:17:38.495585+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790272720,"sha":"482fb46bcc02044219d3723f1b215d76baaa7642","subject":"feat(completion): TAB completion for pending plan names"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"411f560e444f6830d4924893619c1942c1bf86574e4fb498593c2bfdfe931e3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-17z.2/chat.md","size_bytes":3414},"commits":{"digest":"a14b7ceb0decf8a3656e4948219e2dd935538792e28e3ff0024f1edabcf4de22","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-17z.2/commits.json","size_bytes":233},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-17z.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"552acc7acbfbdb5340aa8cbf0322a2ccbac2e69b9e06457a1a4567a5186efb09","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-17z.2/meta.json","size_bytes":68